<img alt="Rigid River's Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rigid River's Heart</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="crafting-professions">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mace_39.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Professions &amp; Crafted Gear for Fury Warriors</span></h2>Every profession is viable in Mists of Pandaria. The gap between professions is no longer as huge, but there are still a few professions that consistently outperform the rest and remain at the top. These professions are Engineering and Blacksmithing.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="engineering">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_engineering.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Engineering for Fury Warriors</h4>Engineering remains the strongest profession for Fury Warriors, providing the powerful on-use cooldown <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> which can be paired with other important damage cooldowns. <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> is also extremely powerful, providing a 150% movement speed boost for 5 seconds.<div data-inserted-ad-group="2" style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
<div data-ad="inline-leaderboard" data-multiformat="true" id="ad_inline-leaderboard_2" style="width: 728px; height: 250px; background: rgba(136, 136, 136, 0.133); --ad-width: 728px; --ad-height: 250px;">
<div data-house-ad="true" data-house-show-before-ad-request="" style="width: 728px; height: 90px;">
<a href="https://tidd.ly/3XmfGSw" target="_blank">
<img alt="ad" src="//r2.rev.iq/wowhead.com/House_BlizzGear_Plushies_728x90.webp"/></a></div></div></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="blacksmithing">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_blacksmithing.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Blacksmithing for Fury Warriors</h4>Blacksmithing ranks as the second-best profession for Warriors. Its substantial value stems from gem changes introduced in the new expansion, which increase the value of <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_socketedbracer.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55641/socket-gloves">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_addsocketglove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Gloves</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The key change is that secondary stat gems now grant double the rating they did previously. This is immense for Fury Warriors, as 1 Critical Strike rating equates to about 1.07 Strength. As a result, gemming <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76697/smooth-suns-radiance">
<img alt="Smooth Sun's Radiance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_yellow.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Smooth Sun's Radiance</span></a> becomes more valuable than gemming <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76696/bold-primordial-ruby">
<img alt="Bold Primordial Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_red.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bold Primordial Ruby</span></a>. Most other professions provide, on average, a 320 main stat bonus, but gemming Critical Strike rating instead yields an equivalent of 684 main stat bonus.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="crafted-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mace_39.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Crafted Gear for Fury Warriors</span></h3>Crafted items from Blacksmithing are not restricted by profession, meaning that even if you aren't a Blacksmith, you can equip anything Blacksmiths craft. Early on, these crafted items will be very powerful, but also expensive.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79327/relic-of-xuen">
<img alt="Relic of Xuen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_tiger.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Xuen</span></a> is the best-crafted item available in Mists of Pandaria Phase 1. If you can only purchase one crafted item, this trinket should be your choice, as it remains BiS throughout the entire phase.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77539/reinforced-retinal-armor">
<img alt="Reinforced Retinal Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_goggles_pandariatradeskill_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Retinal Armor</span></a> is restricted to Engineers, and is a powerful 476 item level option. It has 2 cogwheel sockets, which allow you to gem a specific engineering cogwheel gem, like for example <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77543/precise-tinkers-gear">
<img alt="Precise Tinker's Gear" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Precise Tinker's Gear</span></a>, which provides 600 secondary stat instead of 320.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87407/bloodforged-warfists">
<img alt="Bloodforged Warfists" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodforged Warfists</span></a> is a powerful 496 item level option crafted by Blacksmiths.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87402/ornate-battleplate-of-the-master">
<img alt="Ornate Battleplate of the Master" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raiddeathknight_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ornate Battleplate of the Master</span></a> is another powerful 496 item level option crafted by Blacksmiths.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82975/ghost-reavers-breastplate">
<img alt="Ghost Reaver's Breastplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ghost Reaver's Breastplate</span></a> is a strong 476 item level option crafted by Blacksmiths.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82976/ghost-reavers-gauntlets">
<img alt="Ghost Reaver's Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ghost Reaver's Gauntlets</span></a> is another strong 476 item level option crafted by Blacksmiths.</div></li></ul>
